  "proof_route": "Retain the printed 3.2.18 chart proof, source density, Rademacher, null-image transport and 3.2.17. Prove exact full-density test-family equality under zero omitted density and derive the relative-to-approximate differential identity on original partial graphs. Transport spherical almost-everywhere upper and off-set density conclusions to Hausdorff measure. The final reciprocal-lambda limit uses the elementary inverse-power bound (1+t)^(-p)>=1-p*t and the Archimedean reciprocal lemma."
